  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strengthening Capacity in Development Education (DE) Sector in Ireland project implemented by Centre for Global Education aims to raise the quality of DE practice locally and globally through the publication of two issues of the bi-annual peer reviewed journal Policy and Practice: A Development Education Review. Key activities include the publication of the journal and each issue will be supported by a seminar that will debate and promote the issues.</narrative>
